This directory contains NVIDIA Streamline public headers used to compile the
optional RTGI DLSS Ray Reconstruction handoff.

Only headers are vendored. Runtime binaries such as sl.interposer and DLSS/NGX
artifacts are intentionally external and are detected at runtime.

Imported from NVIDIA's Godot path tracing fork, branch nvidia-pt-dlss,
commit a47a765. The headers carry their own permissive copyright notice.
